OL,3,AUS rapper postpones two arena shows
OL,4,Aafter Manchester evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS rapper Don Toliver has postponed two
OL,7,Fshows in London this week, after his
OL,8,Fconcert in Manchester on Sunday was
OL,9,Fevacuated when an "unknown substance"
OL,10,Fwas released into the crowd.
OL,12,FToliver was due to play The O2 on
OL,13,FMonday and Wembley Arena on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fbut Live Nation said his "stage and
OL,15,Fproduction equipment remains in
OL,16,FManchester and cannot be moved in
OL,17,Ftime".
OL,19,FOne person was taken to hospital and 89
OL,20,Fpeople showed "symptoms believed to be
OL,21,Flinked to the exposure" after Sunday's
OL,22,FCo-op Live arena show, police said.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
