OL,3,AUS rapper postpones two arena shows
OL,4,Aafter Manchester evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans described "distressing scenes"
OL,7,Fwith people "choking", "screaming" and
OL,8,F"coughing up blood" because of the
OL,9,Feffects of a substance, which police
OL,10,Finitially believed to be tear gas.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
