OL,3,AUS to blacklist Asian AI firm Megaspeed
OL,4,Aafter Nvidia scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has said it intends to ban a
OL,7,FSingaporean artificial intelligence
OL,8,F(AI) company allegedly tied to the
OL,9,FNvidia scandal from doing business in
OL,10,FAmerica.
OL,12,FThe Department of Commerce announced it
OL,13,Fplanned to add Megaspeed Ltd to a list
OL,14,Fof entities that are blacklisted from
OL,15,Fbuying or selling goods in the US.
OL,17,FThe company is mainly a developer of
OL,18,Fdata centres, but in recent weeks a
OL,19,Fformer executive of Megaspeed was
OL,20,Faccused of working as spy for China
OL,21,Fwhile having a romantic relationship
OL,22,Fwith Nvidia head Jensen Huang.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
