OL,3,ARussian warship hit by Ukrainian drones
OL,4,Ain Libya, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local health ministry said it had
OL,7,Freceived injured people from a
OL,8,Fcommercial ship that was targeted off
OL,9,Fthe coast of the port. It is not clear
OL,10,Fwhether this is the same vessel as the
OL,11,Fone Ukraine has claimed responsibility
OL,12,Ffor.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
